     "<strong>16.</strong> <math display=\"inline\"><mrow><mo>∃</mo><mi>y</mi><mi>R</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></math> — IP, 15.",
