      "html": "<math display=\"block\"><mrow><msub><mo>∬</mo><mi>A</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>D</mi></msub><mn>1</mn></msubsup><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi>/</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></msubsup><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mi>x</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>/</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mspace width=\"1.0em\"></mspace><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>D</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msqrt><mn>5</mn></msqrt><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mspace width=\"1.0em\"></mspace><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\">planteamendua</mtext><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></math>"
