    "html": "<math display=\"block\"><mrow><mi>δ</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>ρ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mspace width=\"1.0em\"></mspace><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>→</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mo>′</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mspace width=\"1.0em\"></mspace><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo></mrow><mi>θ</mi><mo>→</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mo>′</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo></mrow><mi>θ</mi><mo>,</mo><mspace width=\"1.0em\"></mspace><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo></mrow><mi>θ</mi><mo>→</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mo>′</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>−</mi><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo></mrow><mi>θ</mi></mrow></math> <math display=\"block\"><mrow><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>π</mi></msubsup><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mrow><msup><mn>0</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>−</mi><mi>a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt><mi>d</mi><mi>θ</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>π</mi></msubsup><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>θ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mi>π</mi></mrow></math>"
