      "html": "<math display=\"block\"><mrow><mover><mi>n</mi><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>−</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi><mi>v</mi><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>−</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>,</mo><mspace width=\"1.0em\"></mspace><mrow><mspace width=\"0.333em\"></mspace><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\"> plano ukitzailea: </mtext><mspace width=\"0.333em\"></mspace></mrow><mspace width=\"0.167em\"></mspace><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mspace width=\"1.0em\"></mspace><mi>✓</mi><mrow><mspace width=\"0.333em\"></mspace><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\"> (Em. ofizialarekin bat) </mtext><mspace width=\"0.333em\"></mspace></mrow></mrow></math>"
