      "mota": "testua",
      "html": "<math display=\"block\"><mrow><msub><mo>∬</mo><mi>S</mi></msub><mover><mi>F</mi><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>⋅</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>A</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mi>π</mi><mspace width=\"1.0em\"></mspace><mi>✓</mi><mrow><mspace width=\"0.333em\"></mspace><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\"> (Em. ofizialarekin bat) </mtext><mspace width=\"0.333em\"></mspace></mrow></mrow></math>"
