      "html": "<math display=\"block\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>u</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>−</mi><mn>1</mn><mo>≠</mo><mn>0</mn><mspace width=\"1.0em\"></mspace><mo>⇒</mo><mspace width=\"1.0em\"></mspace><mi>G</mi><mrow><mspace width=\"0.333em\"></mspace><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\"> alderanzgarria </mtext><mspace width=\"0.333em\"></mspace></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo><mrow><mspace width=\"0.333em\"></mspace><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\"> puntuan </mtext><mspace width=\"0.333em\"></mspace></mrow></mrow></math>"
