      "html": "<math display=\"block\"><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mfrac><mi>π</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mspace width=\"0.167em\"></mspace><mi>i</mi><mspace width=\"1.0em\"></mspace><mrow><mspace width=\"0.333em\"></mspace><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\"> edo </mtext><mspace width=\"0.333em\"></mspace></mrow><mspace width=\"1.0em\"></mspace><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>−</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ln</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo><mi>π</mi><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mspace width=\"1.0em\"></mspace><mi>k</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">ℤ</mi></mrow></math>"
