  "izena": "Erabiltzailearen koadernotik",
  "izar": 0,
  "blokeak": [
   {
    "mota": "testua",
    "html": "<math display=\"inline\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">𝑨</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mtable><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center\"><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd columnalign=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center\"><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center\"><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd columnalign=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center\"><mi>−</mi><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></math> matrizearentzat, garatu <math display=\"inline\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">𝑭</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">𝑨</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></math> oinarrizko matrizea zuzenean serie-garapenetik."
   }
  ],
  "ebazpena": [
   {
    "mota": "testua",
    "html": "<math display=\"inline\"><mrow><msup><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">𝑨</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mtable><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center\"><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd columnalign=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center\"><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center\"><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd columnalign=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center\"><mi>−</mi><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mtable><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center\"><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd columnalign=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center\"><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center\"><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd columnalign=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center\"><mi>−</mi><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mtable><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center\"><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd columnalign=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center\"><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center\"><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd columnalign=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center\"><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mn mathvariant=\"bold\">𝟏</mn></mrow></math>, beraz <math display=\"inline\"><mrow><msup><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">𝑨</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>k</mi></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>k</mi></msup><mn mathvariant=\"bold\">𝟏</mn></mrow></math>, <math display=\"inline\"><mrow><msup><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">𝑨</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>k</mi></msup><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">𝑨</mi></mrow></math>. Serie-garapenean ordezkatuta: <math display=\"block\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">𝑭</mi><mo>=</mo><mn mathvariant=\"bold\">𝟏</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>⋯</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">𝑨</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>!</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi>⋯</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></math> Bi serieak <math display=\"inline\"><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cosh</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></math> eta <math display=\"inline\"><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sinh</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo><mi>/</mi><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></math>-ren garapenak dira:"
   },
   {
    "mota": "kutxa",
    "kolorea": "laranja",
    "titulua": null,
    "blokeak": [
     {
      "mota": "testua",
      "html": "<math display=\"block\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">𝑭</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">𝑨</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn mathvariant=\"bold\">𝟏</mn><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cosh</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">𝑨</mi><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sinh</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></math>"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "mota": "ezezaguna",
    "izena": "ebazpen-oharra"
   }
  ]
