    "html": "Aurkitu hurrengo hasierako baldintzen problemaren soluzioa: <math display=\"block\"><mrow><mover><mi>x</mi><mo accent=\"true\">̈</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi>x</mi><mo accent=\"true\">̇</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>δ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>π</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo><mo>,</mo><mspace width=\"1.0em\"></mspace><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mover><mi>x</mi><mo accent=\"true\">̇</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>.</mi></mrow></math>"
