 "03mm_02laplace#59": {
  "mota": "problema",
  "kapitulua": "03mm_02laplace",
  "atala": "a8",
  "atalaIzena": "Problemak",
  "izena": "Atzerapenezko ekuazio diferentzialak",
  "izar": 0,
  "blokeak": [
   {
    "mota": "testua",
    "html": "Har ezazu atzerapenezko ekuazio diferentzialaren soluzio jarraitua <math display=\"block\"><mrow><mover><mi>x</mi><mo accent=\"true\">̇</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></math> <math display=\"inline\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></math> hasierako baldintza betetzen duena <math display=\"inline\"><mrow><mi>−</mi><mn>1</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></math> kasurako. Kalkulatu haren Laplaceren eraldatua eta idatzi <math display=\"inline\"><mrow><msup><mi>s</mi><mrow><mi>−</mi><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>−</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></math>-ren berreduren serie gisa. Kalkulatu alderantzizko eraldatua bilatutako soluzioa aurkitzeko. Soluzio hau bera beste metodoren batez lor daiteke? Aztertu soluzioaren diferentziagarritasuna."
   }
  ],
  "ebazpena": null
 },
 "03mm_02laplace#60": {
  "mota": "problema",
  "kapitulua": "03mm_02laplace",
  "atala": "a8",
  "atalaIzena": "Problemak",
  "izena": null,
  "izar": 0,
  "blokeak": [
   {
    "mota": "testua",
    "html": "Ziurrenik entzun duzu jende-talde bat zubi baten gainean erritmoz markatuz dabilenean haren erorketa eragin dezakeela. Justifikatu gertaera hau hurrengo problema aztertuz: <math display=\"block\"><mrow><mover><mi>x</mi><mo accent=\"true\">̈</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo accent=\"false\">∞</mo></munderover><mi>δ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>k</mi><mi>π</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo><mo>,</mo><mspace width=\"1.0em\"></mspace><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mover><mi>x</mi><mo accent=\"true\">̇</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>.</mi></mrow></math> Zerk eragiten du aipatutako hondamendia baldintza jakin batzuetan soilik gertatzea?"
   }
  ],
  "ebazpena": null
 },
